<p>In 2023, the artist collective SFHIR created this nine-story mural in Fene, Galicia, for the first Perla Mural Fest. At night the instrument comes to life as the building&#8217;s stairwell is illuminated.</p>
<p>The mural was judged best among 50 finalists in the Street Art Cities 2023 awards.</p>
